LAMMPS (4 Jul 2026 - Development - patch_4Jul2026-178-gc4fe7a5bcf)
# =============================================================================
# C06 · COF 膜–水–Na 短程平衡（~501 ps）
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 体系：data.lmp（五层磺酸 COF + 1000 SPC/E + 30 Na；pair.lmp）
# 流程：最小化 → NVT 预松弛（0.2 fs × 5000 ≈ 1 ps）→ NVT 100 ps → NPT(z) 400 ps
#       （部分键角与力场平衡角差较大，先用小步长让高力缓和，再恢复 1 fs）
# 约束：骨架 C/N（type 2–5）fix spring/self（同 C05；仍可动并进全体热浴）
# 控压：仅 z 方向（膜面 xy 固定）；热浴 / NPT 挂 all；thermo 记录 T、pzz、lz
# 输出：log.lammps；NPT 段轨迹 result_atoms.lammpstrj；eq / final data
# =============================================================================

# ----- 可调参数 -----
variable        myrand          equal   58938
variable        mytemp          equal   300.0           # [K]
variable        mypress         equal   1.0             # [atm]，仅 z
variable        tdamp           equal   100.0           # [fs]
variable        pdamp           equal   1000.0          # [fs]
variable        Kspring         equal   100.0           # spring/self [kcal/mol/A^2]

# 段长度
variable        nvt_pre_steps   equal   5000            # 0.2 fs × 5000 ≈ 1 ps 预松弛
variable        nvt_steps       equal   100000          # NVT 100 ps（timestep = 1 fs）
variable        npt_steps       equal   400000          # NPT(z) 400 ps
variable        thermo_every    equal   1000
variable        dump_every      equal   5000            # 5 ps @ 1 fs

# ----- 基本设置 -----
units           real
boundary        p p p

atom_style      full
bond_style      harmonic
angle_style     harmonic
dihedral_style  fourier

special_bonds   lj 0.0 0.0 0.5 coul 0.0 0.0 0.8333
pair_style      lj/cut/coul/cut  12.0  12.0
pair_modify     mix arithmetic  shift yes
#kspace_style    pppm  1.0e-5

read_data       data.lmp
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (-11.278 -19.5341 -25) to (11.278 19.5341 25)
  1 by 2 by 2 MPI processor grid
  reading atoms ...
  3840 atoms
  scanning bonds ...
  3 = max bonds/atom
  scanning angles ...
  6 = max angles/atom
  scanning dihedrals ...
  11 = max dihedrals/atom
  orthogonal box = (-11.278 -19.5341 -25) to (11.278 19.5341 25)
  1 by 2 by 2 MPI processor grid
  reading bonds ...
  2870 bonds
  reading angles ...
  2440 angles
  reading dihedrals ...
  1980 dihedrals
Finding 1-2 1-3 1-4 neighbors ...
  special bond factors lj:    0        0        0.5     
  special bond factors coul:  0        0        0.8333  
     4 = max # of 1-2 neighbors
     7 = max # of 1-3 neighbors
    15 = max # of 1-4 neighbors
    17 = max # of special neighbors
  special bonds CPU = 0.000 seconds
  read_data CPU = 0.023 seconds
include         pair.lmp
pair_coeff    1    1     0.146300     3.048121  # o
pair_coeff    2    2     0.154500     3.279042  # nu
pair_coeff    3    3     0.098800     3.315212  # c
pair_coeff    4    4     0.098800     3.315212  # ca
pair_coeff    5    5     0.098800     3.315212  # ce
pair_coeff    6    6     0.016100     2.625479  # ha
pair_coeff    7    7     0.016100     2.536389  # h4
pair_coeff    8    8     0.010000     1.106496  # hn
pair_coeff    9    9     0.061400     4.058400  # s6
pair_coeff   10   10     0.000000     0.000000  # Hw
pair_coeff   11   11     0.155300     3.166000  # Ow
pair_coeff   12   12     0.352642     2.159538  # Na

neighbor        2.0  bin
neigh_modify    delay 0  every 1  check yes

# ----- 能量最小化（最小化时冻住 COF，只放松水 / Na）-----
group           cof  type  1  2  3  4  5  6  7  8  9
810 atoms in group cof
fix             freecof  cof  setforce  0  0  0
minimize        0.0  1.0e-8  1000  100000
Generated 66 of 66 mixed pair_coeff terms from arithmetic mixing rule
Neighbor list info ...
